# Fabled Passage's fetched basic counts toward "four or more lands" and Fabled Passage itself, sacrificed as a cost,
# does not: three Forests plus the fetched Plains is four, so the Plains is untapped (a ruling: it enters tapped and
# then is untapped). Bot2's lands are not Bot1's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Forest
Fabled Passage
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest#1.Play
Bot2.Hand.Island#1.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest#1.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Fabled Passage.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Fabled Passage.Activate
Bot1.Search(Plains)

[Expect]
Turn = 7
Bot1.Graveyard = Fabled Passage
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Forest; Forest; Plains
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Tapped = false
